<details><summary>What exactly will I receive?</summary><p>Three English PDF files: a 16-page guide, a 5-page workbook with 25 fillable fields, and a one-page quick reference. This is a digital product; nothing is shipped.</p></details><details><summary>Can I type into the workbook?</summary><p>Yes. Open it in a PDF reader that supports forms, save your own copy, and check that your entries remain after reopening. You can also print blank pages and write by hand.</p></details><details><summary>How do I get the files?</summary><p>After successful payment, the download link is sent to the email address used at checkout. If it does not arrive, check your spam folder and contact us with your order number.</p></details><details><summary>Will it cure separation anxiety?</summary><p>No outcome or recovery time is guaranteed. The kit helps organise observations and support planning. It does not replace veterinary assessment or an individual behaviour plan.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a fixed daily schedule?</summary><p>No. The guide avoids universal weekly deadlines. Your dog's individual needs and professional guidance should shape the plan.</p></details><details><summary>Can I see the pages before buying?</summary><p>Yes. <a href="{{ 'guide-preview.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the sample</a> to see the cover, contents and an example record. The full PDFs are delivered after purchase.</p></details>